    "description": "The paper aimed at providing an overview on the p value debate, discussing how it is perceived by the agricultural economics community, and deriving implications for our roles as researchers, contributors to the scientific publication process, and teachers. Following a \u2018Mixed Methods Review\u2019, a systematic literature analysis was complemented by an explorative and descriptive survey on statistical knowledge and practice among the researchers in the agricultural economics community in Austria, Germany and Switzerland.",
